char Kariv and Jaeyoung Shin are the current Class I directors, David Card and Wenying Jia are the current Class II directors, and Hoansoo Lee is the current Class III director. The current terms of Class I, II and III directors will expire at the annual meeting of stockholders to be held in 2027, 2028 and 2029, respectively. Wenying Jia is the current Chairperson of the PubCo Board.","context":"Board Composition","section":"Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":135,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001829126-26-009632","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-09-02","reportDate":"2026-08-27","cik":"0002109869","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2109869/000182912626009632/exascalelabs_8k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/2772b43fb4c1ca00128284534b3f5682d19695d562b78501a17e339205fab772.bin","sha256":"2772b43fb4c1ca00128284534b3f5682d19695d562b78501a17e339205fab772"}},{"id":"2547632adb6e299e2dd2d8cffab3c0ff06fccb8ee1b5bbc19754a8e073228ae1","quote":"The PubCo Board has extensive involvement in the oversight of risk management related to PubCo and its business and accomplished this oversight through the regular reporting to the PubCo Board by the audit committee. The audit committee represents the PubCo Board by periodically reviewing PubCo’s accounting, reporting and financial practices, including the integrity of its financial statements, the surveillance of administrative and financial controls and its compliance with legal and regulatory requirements.","context":"Role of the Board in Risk Oversight","section":"Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":138,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001829126-26-009632","form":"8-K","filedAt":"2026-09-02","reportDate":"2026-08-27","cik":"0002109869",